#: ../../api/flowing.builtins.rst:2
msgid "flowing.builtins package"
msgstr "flowing.builtins package"

#: flowing.builtins:1 of
msgid "``flowing.builtins`` —— 出厂内置工具与标准子智能体（``builtin::`` 命名空间）。"
msgstr "``flowing.builtins`` — factory built-in tools and standard subagents (the ``builtin::`` namespace)."

#: flowing.builtins:4 flowing.builtins.agents:4
#: flowing.builtins.agents.ExploreAgent:4 flowing.builtins.register_builtins:4
#: flowing.builtins.tools:4 flowing.builtins.tools.BashTool:4
#: flowing.builtins.tools.EditTool:4 flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool:4
#: flowing.builtins.tools.GlobTool:4 flowing.builtins.tools.GrepTool:4
