msgid "功能介绍"
msgstr "Overview"

#: flowing.builtins:5 of
msgid ""
"本包是框架随包发布的“出厂自带”能力集合，全部注册在 ``builtin::`` 命名空间下（注册行为见 "
":func:`register_builtins`，由 ``Runtime`` 构造 期自动执行，随每个 ``Runtime`` 实例天生在场）："
msgstr ""
"This package is the set of capabilities shipped out of the box with the framework, all registered under the "
"``builtin::`` namespace (registration is performed by :func:`register_builtins`, which runs automatically during ``Runtime`` construction, so it is inherently present in every ``Runtime`` instance):"

#: flowing.builtins:9 of
msgid ""
":mod:`flowing.builtins.tools` —— 内置工具全集：核心内置 ``subagent-invoke`` "
"（子智能体唤起入口）与出厂内置的 ``finish`` （子 Agent 可选交卷），加六个标准文件 / shell 工具 ``read`` / "
"``write`` / ``bash`` / ``edit`` / ``grep`` / ``glob``；"
msgstr ""
":mod:`flowing.builtins.tools` — the full set of built-in tools: the core built-in ``subagent-invoke`` "
"(the subagent invocation entry point) and the shipped ``finish`` (optional result submission for sub-agents), plus six standard file / shell tools ``read`` / "
"``write`` / ``bash`` / ``edit`` / ``grep`` / ``glob``;"

#: flowing.builtins:13 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.builtins.agents` —— 标准子智能体 ``ExploreAgent`` （只读代码库探索）。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.builtins.agents` — the standard subagent ``ExploreAgent`` (read-only codebase exploration)."

#: flowing.builtins:17 flowing.builtins.tools:16 of
msgid "全局约定（跨符号、影响使用的约定）"
msgstr "Global Conventions (cross-symbol conventions that affect usage)"

#: flowing.builtins:18 of
msgid ""
"注册不等于可见。条目进入注册表只代表“框架认识它”，不代表 LLM 能看到 它：Agent "
"的工具目录（``Context.tools``）只包含该 Agent 在 ``.fya`` 的 ``tools:`` 或 ``add_tool``"
" 中显式声明的条目；可写文件、执行命令的危险 工具（``write`` / ``bash`` / ``edit`` 等）必须由使用者显式声明才会被"
" LLM 看到——框架不会因为注册就把它们暴露给 LLM，这是安全边界，不是疏忽。 标准子智能体同理：``ExploreAgent`` 需亲代 "
"Agent 在 ``subagents:`` 或 ``add_agent`` 中显式声明才会进入其 catalog。"
msgstr ""
"Registration does not imply visibility. An entry being in the registry only means the framework knows it; it does not mean the LLM can see it: an agent's "
"tool catalog (``Context.tools``) contains only entries explicitly declared by that agent in ``tools:`` of its ``.fya`` or via ``add_tool``"
"; dangerous tools that write files or execute commands (``write`` / ``bash`` / ``edit`` etc.) must be explicitly declared by the user before the"
" LLM can see them — the framework never exposes them to the LLM merely because they are registered. This is a security boundary, not an oversight. The same applies to standard subagents: ``ExploreAgent`` enters a parent "
"agent's catalog only when explicitly declared in ``subagents:`` or via ``add_agent``."

#: flowing.builtins:26 of
msgid ""
"``builtin::`` 是裸名查找的兜底层：裸名引用先查 ``default::`` 再查 ``builtin::``——插件 / 应用可在 "
"``default::`` 注册同名条目覆盖内置行为， 被覆盖的条目仍可用 ``builtin::xxx`` 全限定名显式引用。"
msgstr ""
"``builtin::`` is the fallback layer for bare-name lookup: a bare-name reference is looked up in ``default::`` first, then ``builtin::`` — plugins / applications may register "
"same-named entries under ``default::`` to override the built-in behavior; overridden entries can still be explicitly referenced via the fully qualified name ``builtin::xxx``."

#: flowing.builtins:31 flowing.builtins.agents:14
#: flowing.builtins.agents.ExploreAgent:15 flowing.builtins.tools:37
#: flowing.builtins.tools.FinishTool:15
#: flowing.builtins.tools.SubagentInvokeTool:19 of
msgid "使用示例"
msgstr "Examples"

#: flowing.builtins:32 of
msgid "``.fya`` 中显式声明本 Agent 可用的工具（只读工具直接声明；危险工具同样 必须显式声明才会对 LLM 可见）::"
msgstr "Explicitly declare in ``.fya`` the tools available to this agent (read-only tools are declared directly; dangerous tools must likewise be explicitly declared to be visible to the LLM)::"

#: flowing.builtins:43 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.builtins.tools` —— 内置工具全集。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.builtins.tools` — the full set of built-in tools."

#: flowing.builtins:44 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.builtins.agents` —— 标准子智能体。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.builtins.agents` — standard subagents."

#: flowing.builtins:45 of
msgid ":mod:`flowing.tool` —— ``builtin::`` / ``default::`` 命名空间与 裸名查找规则。"
msgstr ":mod:`flowing.tool` — the ``builtin::`` / ``default::`` namespaces and the bare-name lookup rules."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.BashTool:1 of
msgid "``bash`` —— 经 ``/bin/bash`` 执行 shell 命令（高危可写工具）。"
msgstr "``bash`` — execute shell commands via ``/bin/bash`` (high-risk writable tool)."

#: flowing.builtins.tools.BashTool:5 of
msgid ""
"LLM 在宿主环境执行 shell 命令的工具：命令经 ``/bin/bash -c`` 运行， 返回 ``stdout`` / "
"``stderr`` / ``exit_code`` 拼成的文本。高危工具—— 任意命令执行，继承 Agent 进程的全部权限。"
msgstr ""
"The tool with which the LLM executes shell commands in the host environment: the command runs via ``/bin/bash -c`` and returns "
"text assembled from ``stdout`` / ``stderr`` / ``exit_code``. High-risk tool — arbitrary command execution, inheriting all permissions of the agent process."

#: flowing.builtins.agents.ExploreAgent:23
#: flowing.builtins.register_builtins:11 flowing.builtins.tools.BashTool:10
#: flowing.builtins.tools.BashTool.execute:4 flowing.builtins.tools.EditTool:9
#: flowing.builtins.tools.EditTool.execute:4
